[PrintTextModified Text:（这是什么……）|#0103Adv03_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:小心翼翼地用指头摸了摸，<br>触碰到了一个坚硬而粗糙的物体。|#0103Adv03_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:1.5 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,40 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1 SubId:Middle

