[PrintTextModified Text:尽管身体发冷颤抖，<br>艾玛还是日复一日地坚持挖掘着坚硬的土地。|#0103Adv03_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（一定要逃出去……！）|#0103Adv03_Ema009| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

